1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:00,520
Si t’étais

2
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:01,400
astronaute, tu

3
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,480
dormirais comment ?

4
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:03,560
Première nouvelle,

5
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:04,880
pas sympa.

6
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:05,800
Dans l'espace,

7
00:00:05,800 --> 00:00:07,080
tu peux t'étouffer...

8
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,240
en dormant.

9
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:09,240
Sans gravité,

10
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:09,560
l'air

11
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:10,400
que tu expires

12
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:11,160
reste en bulle

13
00:00:11,160 --> 00:00:12,240
autour de ta tête.

14
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:12,560
Alors

15
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:13,280
des ventilateurs

16
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:14,040
tournent toute

17
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:14,840
la nuit.

18
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:15,960
Deuxième nouvelle.

19
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:16,360
Il y a

20
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:17,040
plein de bruit

21
00:00:17,040 --> 00:00:18,000
et plein de lumière

22
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:19,000
dans une station.

23
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:19,560
Le soleil

24
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,400
se lève jusqu'à

25
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:21,160
seize fois

26
00:00:21,160 --> 00:00:22,040
par jour.

27
00:00:22,040 --> 00:00:22,800
Donc masque

28
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:23,520
sur les yeux,

29
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:23,960
bouchons

30
00:00:23,960 --> 00:00:24,880
dans les oreilles.

31
00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:25,560
Et comme il n'y

32
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:26,360
a pas de gravité,

33
00:00:26,360 --> 00:00:27,440
il y a ni eau ni.

34
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:28,320
Bah tu dors

35
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:28,800
dans un sac

36
00:00:28,800 --> 00:00:29,440
de couchage

37
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,680
accroché au mur.

38
00:00:30,680 --> 00:00:31,840
Troisième nouvelle,

39
00:00:31,840 --> 00:00:33,080
La bonne.

40
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:33,560
Eux,

41
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:34,040
ils n'ont

42
00:00:34,040 --> 00:00:34,520
pas de pluie

43
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:35,400
sur un toit,

44
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,000
pas de terrasse

45
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:36,800
de café,

46
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,280
pas de rue

47
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:38,280
qui s'endort.

48
00:00:38,280 --> 00:00:40,520
Toi si sur Listen,

49
00:00:40,560 --> 00:00:41,200
t'écoutes des

50
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:41,760
vrais endroits

51
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:42,400
de la Terre.

52
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:43,080
Enregistré

53
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,080
sur place.

54
00:00:44,080 --> 00:00:44,840
Si t'en mettais un

55
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,400
